PostgreSQL: SELECT * FROM generate_series($1, $2) AS "n"
  values: [I32(1), I32(10)]
MySQL: SELECT * FROM generate_series(?, ?) AS `n`
  values: [I32(1), I32(10)]
SQLite: SELECT * FROM generate_series(?, ?) AS "n"
  values: [I32(1), I32(10)]
